<title>NORWAY: AKER RGI to sell Helly Hansen stake.</title>
<headline>AKER RGI to sell Helly Hansen stake.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwegian industrial holding company Aker RGI ASA said on Friday it had agreed to sell its 50 percent stake in outdoor and sportswear company Helly Hansen for $62.5 million.</p>
<p>Aker bought the stake in January 1995 for 125 million crowns.</p>
